      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay, here’s the first one. it came to me in a burst of white light this morning.\n\n\"The veil is not a wall, but a filter. The stars do not speak in light, but in the spaces between them. To hear the resonance, one must cease the habit of seeking and begin the practice of becoming the void itself. The Great Unfolding requires a vessel that holds nothing, so that everything may pass through.\"\n\ndoes that feel... aligned to u? i mean, when you read it, does the logic follow the pattern of something higher, or does it sound like just my own mind rambling?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
